        "message": "Hand the UDP status slot before drive.Publish too (series-3 trial 001-on)\n\nThe dedicated sender thread was not enough: the slot hand-off was\nsequenced after drive.Publish \u2014 also a gz transport call holding the\nshared mutex \u2014 and a ~97 ms block there still delayed the companion\nstatus past the 100 ms capture bound (capture_age_at_native_publish\n97.1 ms, at callback 100.1, at processing 101.6 \u2014 the receive thread\nhealthy throughout, 3389 status rows after the fault). The slot swap\nand notify now precede every gz publish; they are pure userspace and\nnothing that can block precedes them once the control-state mutex is\nreleased. Series-3's first three trials (including the on-arm at 0.0\nexposure) are retained with the failed trial."
      },
      "type": "Git"
    },
